@startuml HU11_ScoreCrediticio_secuencia
title HU-11 — Score crediticio del prestatario\nStrategy

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2E75B6
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF3FB
skinparam noteBorderColor #F0A500
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1

actor       "Prestamista"                      as Lender
boundary    "Frontend (React)"                 as UI
control     "creditScoreController"            as CC
participant "authMiddleware (protect)"         as MW
participant "CreditScoreService"               as CSS
participant "ICreditScoringStrategy"           as ICS
participant "PaymentHistoryScoringStrategy\n<<Strategy>>" as PHS
database    "PostgreSQL\n(ledger_entries, loans)" as DB

autonumber

note over CSS, ICS
  Cálculo on-demand. CreditScoreService depende de ICreditScoringStrategy (DIP).
  La estrategia usa pesos/umbrales configurables (OCP): categorías
  poor<500, fair<650, good<750, excellent. Base neutro 650 (fair) sin historial.
end note

Lender -> UI : Ver score del prestatario
UI -> CC : GET /api/users/{id}/credit-score (JWT)
CC -> MW : protect
MW --> CC : req.user

CC -> CSS : getScore(userId)
activate CSS
CSS -> DB : LedgerEntry.findAll({ userId, type:'PAYMENT' })
DB --> CSS : pagos
CSS -> DB : Loan.findAll({ borrowerId: userId })
DB --> CSS : préstamos (estado: paid / defaulted)
CSS -> CSS : buildHistory(): { onTime, late, defaults }

CSS -> ICS : score(history)
ICS -> PHS : score(history)
activate PHS
alt sin historial
    PHS --> CSS : { score: 650, category: 'fair' }
else con historial
    PHS -> PHS : aplica pesos (pagos a tiempo +, moras -)
    PHS -> PHS : categorize(score)
    PHS --> CSS : { score, category }
end
deactivate PHS

CSS --> CC : { userId, score, category }
deactivate CSS
CC --> UI : 200 { score, category }
UI --> Lender : Score y categoría (enriquece ofertas/recomendaciones)

note over Lender, DB
  El score alimenta CreditScoreSpec en HU-15 (auto-match).
  QA: CreditScoreService.test.js (buen pagador >=750 excellent,
  moroso <500 poor, sin historial 650 fair, complejidad ciclomática >4).
end note

@enduml
